OL,3,GNEWSACouncil cuts 'the most terrible
OL,4,Athing I've had to do'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Shropshire Council has
OL,7,Fdescribed the cuts she has to make as
OL,8,Fpart of the authority's ongoing
OL,9,Ffinancial emergency as "the most
OL,10,Fterrible thing I've ever had to do".
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat Heather Kidd has
OL,13,Fworked as a local councillor for three
OL,14,Fdecades and took on the authority in
OL,15,FMay 2025.
OL,17,FWith more cuts to come and another
OL,18,Fcouncil tax rise of more than 5%
OL,19,Flikely, Kidd said the decisions were
OL,20,F"painful" for her.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
