OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil cuts 'the most terrible
OL,4,Athing I've had to do'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"All of these decisions are hugely
OL,7,Fpersonal to me, and it's not what I
OL,8,Fwanted to do. I never came in to
OL,9,Fpolitics to make these difficult
OL,10,Fdecisions, but what we can do is try
OL,11,Fand protect the people that need
OL,12,Fprotection and find better ways of
OL,13,Fdoing things for the future," she said.
